NOTICE — Rights and attribution for the Estonian Legal Ontology
===============================================================

STATUS: DRAFT. This NOTICE records the rights model the project intends to
operate under. Several statements below are marked "VERIFY" because they depend
on the live terms of upstream sources or on legal review that has not yet been
completed. Do NOT treat the VERIFY items as settled law, and do NOT publish or
redistribute the data as if the rights position were confirmed until a lawyer /
the data owner has signed off. See docs/DATA_RIGHTS.md for the prose
explanation and docs/DATA_PROTECTION.md for personal-data handling.

This repository bundles two very different kinds of material:

  1. SOFTWARE  — the code and scripts (scripts/, mcp_server/, tests/, tooling).
     Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE). This NOTICE does not change
     that.

  2. DATA      — the JSON-LD corpus under krr_outputs/ and related artifacts.
     The data is predominantly third-party content and is NOT covered by the
     MIT License. Its rights are layered by source, as set out below.

The data layer is a compilation. It bundles:
  (a) third-party legal texts that the project did not author, each retaining
      its own source rights; and
  (b) an original compilation layer authored by this project — the selection
      and arrangement, the cross-references and links, the minted IRIs, the
      ontology/TBox structure, the controlled vocabularies, and the derived
      classifications. Layer (b) is the project's own contribution (and the
      subject of any database right the project itself may hold).


